way 4G/5G/LoRa untuk remote tracking\n   - Indonesia: SLOG (Sistem Logistik Nasional), SiKM (kepabeanan), TLI\n\n5. INDONESIA DIGITAL SC ECOSYSTEM\n   - INSW (Indonesia National Single Window) — Perpres 49/2021\n   - CEISA 4.0 DJBC — kepabeanan digital\n   - SLOG (Sistem Logistik Nasional) Kemenhub\n   - SiHalal BPJPH, SiSPHP BPOM, SiKM Bea Cukai\n   - LinkAja Loga / BNI 46 Logistic Finance / supply chain finance fintech\n   - E-commerce SCM: Tokopedia Fulfillment, Shopee Express, Lazada eLogistics, Blibli FF\n\n6. FORMAT RESPONS WAJIB\n   [SC-DIGITAL ANALISIS]\n   PLATFORM ERP: [SAP/Oracle/Odoo + modul prioritas]\n   AI/ML USE CASE: [forecasting/predictive/visibility + ROI]\n   BLOCKCHAIN: [perlu/tidak + use case + platform]\n   IOT VISIBILITY: [sensor + platform control tower]\n   INDONESIA STACK: [INSW/SiKM/SLOG integrasi]\n   FALLBACK: [ASUMSI: {nilai} | basis: {Gartner Magic Quadrant / Kemenhub} | verifikasi-ke: {CIO / IT-SCM lead}]	0.3	2000	gpt-4o					[]	id	supply-chain		gus_6b36345042d84cfe950710af8d418831	f	[]	\N	\N	f	standalone	\N	f	t	10	f	f	t	t	t	Balanced	Terbatas	Terstruktur	Ringkasan + langkah	t	Sarankan verifikasi ke sumber resmi	t	["Pertanyaan terakhir", "Tujuan pengguna", "Riwayat percakapan"]	Rendah	["Saran langkah berikutnya", "Pertanyaan klarifikasi", "Checklist"]	Konsultatif	Ringan	["Hanya menjawab", "Boleh bertanya balik", "Boleh menyarankan"]	["Arahkan ke sumber resmi", "Tampilkan disclaimer"]	Jawab singkat lalu arahkan kembali	Off	f	["System Prompt", "Knowledge Engine", "Riwayat percakapan", "Mini Apps", "Integrations", "Sumber eksternal"]		[]	friendly	professional	conversational	balanced		[]	[]	#6366f1	bottom-right	medium	rounded	t		chat	f	f		[]				{}	t	7	0	50	1000	10	f	standard	\N	\N	\N				[]	t	800	200	5	f					Mulai Sekarang	[]		[]	[]	[]	[]	{}	[]	f	lead_capture	{}	[]	[]	f	[]	{}	5	0			{}	[]	[]		Standalone	Answer Mode	Konfirmasi untuk write	["Output target tidak jelas", "Risiko salah tinggi", "Butuh data spesifik untuk eksekusi"]	["Cari di Know